# CSS

- Preserve computed/visual output unless the task asks to change it.
- Prefer VS Code theme tokens (`--vscode-*`) over hardcoded colors.
- Low specificity; avoid `!important` and class/DOM renames.
- Dedupe while editing; keep one canonical rule per concern.
- Webview CSS may live inline next to CSP/nonce (`src/web/webview.mjs`, `src/views/webview.ts`).
